      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>This fix should ensure that <a href=\"https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2999\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2999</a> be a viable solution.</p>\n\n<p> </p>",
     "created": "31/May/19 4:03 AM",
     "id": "20692",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/12893/comment/20692",
     "updateAuthor": {
      "accountId": "60785e2552404d0070bf1d34",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3707b443358c8c223f9eec7a7d29ba88?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FDB-4.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3707b443358c8c223f9eec7a7d29ba88?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FDB-4.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3707b443358c8c223f9eec7a7d29ba88?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FDB-4.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3707b443358c8c223f9eec7a7d29ba88?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FDB-4.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Danny Bernstein",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=60785e2552404d0070bf1d34",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "updated": "31/May/19 4:03 AM"
    },
    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "6089a4c12a753d0071341edb",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/45c30a3354c38331cc42d11962474554?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FJW-1.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/45c30a3354c38331cc42d11962474554?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FJW-1.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/45c30a3354c38331cc42d11962474554?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FJW-1.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/45c30a3354c38331cc42d11962474554?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FJW-1.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Jared Whiklo",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a4c12a753d0071341edb",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>This fix requires the addition of <tt>acl:default</tt> but for a specific Fedora only purpose. It is meant to say that things below inherit this ACL, but (and I'm doing some guessing here) because the ACL is actually on the parent the <tt>acl:default</tt> is the only important part. The system doesn't find an ACL on the child, then moves up to the parent and sees an <tt>acl:default</tt> so it passes it down.</p>\n\n<p>I'd say that either</p>\n\n<p>a) we change so that when the current resource doesn't have an ACL we move up the tree and check first for an acl:accessTo of the original resource and second for an acl:default for a parent. Having multiple AUTHZ in a single ACL means we need to ensure that the AUTHZ with acl:default is not for a child of the checked resource.</p>\n\n<p>b) We don't respect acl:accessTo that is not the current resource. So you have acl:accessTo and acl:default or acl:accessToClass and acl:default to affect nested resources.</p>",
     "created": "05/Jun/19 12:07 PM",
     "id": "20695",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/12893/comment/20695",
     "updateAuthor": {
      "accountId": "6089a4c12a753d0071341edb",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/45c30a3354c38331cc42d11962474554?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FJW-1.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/45c30a3354c38331cc42d11962474554?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FJW-1.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/45c30a3354c38331cc42d11962474554?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FJW-1.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/45c30a3354c38331cc42d11962474554?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FJW-1.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Jared Whiklo",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a4c12a753d0071341edb",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "updated": "05/Jun/19 12:07 PM"
    },
    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "60785e2552404d0070bf1d34",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3707b443358c8c223f9eec7a7d29ba88?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FDB-4.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3707b443358c8c223f9eec7a7d29ba88?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FDB-4.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3707b443358c8c223f9eec7a7d29ba88?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FDB-4.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3707b443358c8c223f9eec7a7d29ba88?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FDB-4.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Danny Bernstein",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=60785e2552404d0070bf1d34",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>We have decided not to support acl:accessTo and acl:default values that refer to children of the ACL's resource.</p>",
     "created": "06/Jun/19 3:57 PM",
     "id": "20697",
     "jsdPublic": true,
